  "title": "Nordic Regional NWP Models",
  "description": "Hourly atmospheric analysis and forecast archive for the Nordic region and Arctic, derived from two regional numerical weather prediction models: the Danish HARMONIE model (2 km resolution, covering Greenland and Iceland) and the MetCoOp MEPS model (2.5 km resolution, covering the broader Nordic region). The archive is constructed by retaining the first three forecast steps of each model run to approximate an hourly analysis, stored in cloud-native Icechunk/Zarr format.",
